    /// <para>Reads every card in a photo: number, expiry and holder with their confidences, the checks (Luhn, length for the network, expiry), the BIN record and the issuer in the bank directory. The full number is in this response only; the stored copy keeps the first six and last four digits, and the photo is never stored.</para>
    /// <para>Price: 0.03 credits per successful call.</para>
    /// </summary>
    /// <param name="parameters">The upload: the file and its options, sent as <c>multipart/form-data</c>.</param>
